  <p id="c-suishu-047-weiguang-family-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-suishu-047-weiguang-family-context:p001:m0000" ref="fh0_oxc_05e_AA">韋世康</persName>，京兆杜陵人也，世為關右著姓。祖<persName id="c-suishu-047-weiguang-family-context:p001:m0019" ref="fh0_oxc_05e">旭</persName>，魏南幽州刺史。父<persName id="c-suishu-047-weiguang-family-context:p001:m0029" ref="fh0_oxc_05e_A">夐</persName>，隱居不仕</p>
  <p id="c-suishu-047-weiguang-family-context:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">弟<persName id="c-suishu-047-weiguang-family-context:p002:m0001" ref="fh0_oxc_05e_AB">洸</persName></p>
